{"sections":[{"slug":"Riemannζ-函数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Riemannζ-函数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Riemann ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Riemann ζ-函数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathrm{Re}s &gt; 1$,\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s)=\\sum_{n\\geq 1}n^{-s}=\\prod_{p}\\frac{1}{1-p^{-s}}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">大写的</span>) Zeta-<span lang=\"zh\">函数为</span> $\\zeta$ <span lang=\"zh\">乘上</span> “Gamma-<span lang=\"zh\">因子</span>”\n$$\r\nZ(s)=\\pi^{-s/2}\\Gamma(s/2)\\zeta(s),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\Gamma$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathrm{Re}s&gt;0$ <span lang=\"zh\">时的定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\Gamma(s)=\\int_0^\\infty e^{-t}t^s \\frac{dt}{t},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而在其它处由函数方程延拓</span>:\n$$\r\n\\Gamma(s+1)=s\\Gamma(s).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. Zeta-<span lang=\"zh\">函数可延拓为复平面上的亚纯函数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $s=1$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个留数为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单极点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $s=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个留数为</span> $-1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单极点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">没有其它极点</span>. Zeta <span lang=\"zh\">函数满足方程</span>\n$$\r\nZ(s)=Z(1-s).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Riemann ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数的倒数是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Möbius函数","text":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">级数</span>:\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\sum_{n\\geq 1}n^{-s} = \\Big(\\sum_{n\\geq 1}\\mu(n)n^{-s}\\Big)^{-1}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/ζ-函数","text":"ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Dedekindζ-函数","text":"Dedekind ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}